   "cls": null
  },
  {
   "text": "it's",
   "size": 28.48,
   "tag": "span",
   "cls": null
  },
  {
   "text": "just",
   "size": 28.48,
   "tag": "span",
   "cls": null
  },
  {
   "text": "gone",
   "size": 28.48,
   "tag": "span",
   "cls": null
  },
  {
   "text": "quarter",
   "size": 28.48,
   "tag": "span",
   "cls": null
  },
  {
   "text": "past",
   "size": 28.48,
   "tag": "span",
   "cls": null
  },
  {
   "text": "one.",
   "size": 28.48,
   "tag": "span",
   "cls": null
  },
  {
   "text": "The room, so far",
   "size": 19.2,
   "tag": "h2",
   "cls": "mt-1.5"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mumble",
   "size": 15.68,
   "tag": "span",
   "cls": null
  },
  {
   "text": "You're on the night shift with me and it's just gone quarter past one.",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Which means the calls are about to get honest, that's how it always go",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every week. Twelve to two and people start telling me the truth about ",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "I still think about the man who called about the kettle he kept in the",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Some objects get a face and you can't throw them out. That's just bein",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hi, sorry, I know it's late where you are.",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Not at all, the desk is open until midnight. How can I help?",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "The calmer one is the one by the window, if that's possible.",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Low-key is a perfectly good way to spend an evening. Confirmed.",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Rain on a metal roof is the cheapest orchestra, and we had front row s",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "I learned that laughter needs no wattage, though it does need someone.",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay for the second half, there's tea at the back.",
   "size": 13.44,
   "tag": "p",
   "cls": "mt-1"
  },
  {
   "text": "June",
   "size": 10.56,
   "tag": "span",
   "cls": "uppercase"
  }
 ]
